---
source: crates/crucible-tui/src/markdown/corpus_pictures.rs
expression: "pictured(\"inline\", 40, Glyphs::Ascii)"
---
A line that ends in a backslash         
continues on the next row.              
                                        
An ampersand written as &, a tag as     
<tag>, a copy as © and a number as ©.   
                                        
An empty reference &#0; and an override 
&#x202E; are written as they came.      
                                        
~one~ is struck under GitHub's rules,   
and <Struck>two</> is struck under both.           
                                        
A pair may cross a line break: ~the     
phrase goes                             
on~ here.                               
                                        
And these strike nothing: edit          
~/.config/crucible/config.json then     
~/bin/run, between ~/a and ~/b, about ~5
minutes or ~10.                         
                                        
Nested emphasis: <Bold>both</>, <Bold>bold </><Bold>italic</><Bold> bold</>,
and <Emphasis>leant </><Bold>and raised</><Emphasis> again</>.             
                                        
The corpus ends here.
